==Battleground==
*6 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Znache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hackey]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is extremely simple to the point where you can just use two units and win; [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]]. Of course, bringing other units such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] can help you clear the stage more consistently.

The zombies will just burrow underneath your cats, allowing your Manic Islands or whatever is attacking the Hackey to shred it. Cadaver BearCat will clean up whatever burrows underneath along with the Coffin Zoges.

